    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful Crown is a nostalgic childhood classic side-scrolling combat RPG. The world in the painting is full of anomalies, and players can start an epic adventure by obtaining equipment and levelling up to improve their combat power. Familiarise yourself with the enemy's moves, use skill combinations to recover the colourful crown, and calm the vision in the painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tale</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story is one of them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >characteristic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Exciting boss battles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your power to face dangerous and powerful enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Classic RPG Experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of acquiring equipment and improving attributes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Colorful Crown&quot; was independently developed and produced by one person in 2.5 months.</p>",
